TY  - JOUR
ID  - arxiv-2508.03145v1
AU  - Joost NUITEN, Bertrand TOEN
TI  - Θ -Categories and Tannakian duality
UR  - https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.03145
AB  - We introduce a notion of Θ-categories, which is a refinement of the notion of symmetric monoidal ∞-categories. We use this notion to prove a Tannakian duality statement, relating Θ-categories with fpqc- stacks by means of a certain stack of fiber functors in the context of Θ-categories. This provides, over a base ring of arbitrary characteris- tic, a strong link between Tannakian Θ-categories and the schematic homotopy types of [Toe06].
ER  - 
